### POST request for a patients
### valid
POST http://localhost:4000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Andi Pratama",
  "email": "andi.pratama@mail.com",
  "address": "Bandung",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-03-21",
  "registeredDate": "2024-01-10"
}


###
